There's a question in the proposal under "Definition" about possible rafsi
for kanpe. I see only three possibilities if only the letters of the word
are used in their original order: kan, kap, and ka'e. All three are already
in use (for kansa, skapi, kakne). Of course, there is always kanpy-.

stevo


